     Talkman leftover Tethering overlay. No LGE Entitlement.apk
     (com.lge.entitlement). MATCH leftover: hotspot provision arrays
     empty. Dual SIM is not talkman (RM-1104 4VM_08r). CAF 3.10 has no
     tether BPF offload.
-->
